{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"向量数据库与记忆检索\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">解释 Agent 长期记忆使用向量数据库的原因，详细说明 Embedding、相似度计算和 ANN（近似最近邻）搜索的原理，以及工程实现中的选型要点。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>为什么用向量数据库</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 的长期记忆需要支持<strong>语义检索</strong>——用自然语言查询找到相关的记忆，而不是精确匹配关键词。向量数据库通过将文本转换为高维向量（Embedding），使得语义相似的文本在向量空间中距离相近，从而实现\"意思相近就能找到\"的检索效果。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心流程</strong>：</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">文本 → Embedding 模型 → 高维向量 → 存入向量数据库\n查询文本 → Embedding → 向量检索 → 返回最相似的 Top-K 条记忆\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Embedding 原理</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Embedding 是将离散的文本（token）映射到连续的向量空间的过程。现代 Embedding 模型（如 OpenAI text-embedding-ada-003、BGE、M3E）通过大规模预训练学习语义表示，使得：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">语义相似的文本 → 向量距离近</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">语义不同的文本 → 向量距离远</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">向量维度通常为 384-dim（轻量模型）到 1536-dim（OpenAI）或 1024-dim（BGE）。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>相似度计算</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">常用的向量相似度度量方式：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>余弦相似度（Cosine Similarity）</strong>：<br>\n<span class=\"math math-block is-loaded\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D460 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mfrac space=\"4\"><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cD7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-math></mjx-container></span>最常用，范围 [-1, 1]，只考虑方向不考虑大小。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>欧氏距离（Euclidean Distance）</strong>：<br>\n<span class=\"math math-block is-loaded\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D451 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msqrt space=\"4\"><mjx-sqrt class=\"mjx-tall\"><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-v class=\"mjx-c221A\" style=\"height: 3.6em; vertical-align: -1.05em;\"><mjx-beg><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-beg><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-end><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-end><mjx-mark></mjx-mark></mjx-stretchy-v></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.451em;\"><mjx-munderover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.192em; padding-left: 0.51em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-over><mjx-box><mjx-munder><mjx-row><mjx-base><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2211 TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-base></mjx-row><mjx-row><mjx-under style=\"padding-top: 0.167em; padding-left: 0.148em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-under></mjx-row></mjx-munder></mjx-box></mjx-munderover><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.289em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt></mjx-math></mjx-container></span>考虑绝对距离，适合需要严格距离度量的场景。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>点积（Dot Product）</strong>：<br>\n<span class=\"math math-block is-loaded\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D451 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-munderover space=\"4\"><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.192em; padding-left: 0.51em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-over><mjx-box><mjx-munder><mjx-row><mjx-base><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2211 TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-base></mjx-row><mjx-row><mjx-under style=\"padding-top: 0.167em; padding-left: 0.148em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-under></mjx-row></mjx-munder></mjx-box></mjx-munderover><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cD7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math></mjx-container></span>计算简单，但受向量长度影响。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> numpy <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> np\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">cosine_similarity</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>a<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ndarray<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> b<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ndarray<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"计算余弦相似度\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dot<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>a<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> b<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>linalg<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>norm<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>a<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>linalg<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>norm<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>b<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">euclidean_distance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>a<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ndarray<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> b<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ndarray<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"计算欧氏距离\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>linalg<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>norm<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>a <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> b<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">top_k_similar</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query_embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ndarray<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                  memory_embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ndarray<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                  k<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"找到最相似的 Top-K 个向量\"\"\"</span>\n    similarities <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dot<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>memory_embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query_embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    top_k_indices <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>argsort<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>similarities<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>k<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> top_k_indices<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tolist<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>ANN 搜索原理</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">当记忆数量达到百万级以上时，暴力计算所有相似度太慢。ANN（Approximate Nearest Neighbor）通过牺牲少量精度换取大幅速度提升。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">常用 ANN 算法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>HNSW（Hierarchical Navigable Small World）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">构建多层图结构，上层稀疏、下层密集</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">搜索时从顶层开始，逐层向下逼近最近邻</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">优点：搜索速度快、支持动态增删</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">缺点：内存占用较大</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>IVF（Inverted File Index）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">将向量空间聚类为多个簇（Voronoi 单元）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">搜索时先找到最近的几个簇，只在簇内搜索</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">常与 PQ（Product Quantization）压缩结合</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>PQ（Product Quantization）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">将高维向量分割为子向量，分别量化</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">大幅减少存储，适合亿级数据</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 使用 Faiss 构建 ANN 索引的简单示例</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> faiss\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> numpy <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> np\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">build_ann_index</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ndarray<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> index_type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"HNSW\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"构建 ANN 索引\"\"\"</span>\n    dim <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>shape<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> index_type <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"HNSW\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># HNSW 索引</span>\n        index <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> faiss<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>IndexHNSWFlat<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>dim<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">32</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 32 = M (邻居数)</span>\n        index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>hnsw<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>efConstruction <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">200</span>\n        index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> index_type <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"IVF\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># IVF 索引</span>\n        nlist <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 簇数量</span>\n        quantizer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> faiss<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>IndexFlatIP<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>dim<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        index <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> faiss<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>IndexIVFFlat<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>quantizer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> dim<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> nlist<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>train<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 暴力搜索（小数据量）</span>\n        index <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> faiss<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>IndexFlatIP<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>dim<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> index\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">ann_search</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>index<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query_embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> np<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ndarray<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> k<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"ANN 检索\"\"\"</span>\n    scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> indices <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query_embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>reshape<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> k<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> indices<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>选型要点</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据库</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>FAISS</td>\n<td>Meta 开源，算法丰富</td>\n<td>研究、嵌入式部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Milvus/Zilliz</td>\n<td>分布式、云原生</td>\n<td>大规模生产环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pinecone</td>\n<td>全托管、易用</td>\n<td>快速上线、不想运维</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weaviate</td>\n<td>支持混合搜索（向量+BM25）</td>\n<td>需要关键词+语义搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ChromaDB</td>\n<td>轻量、易集成</td>\n<td>原型开发、小项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qdrant</td>\n<td>Rust 实现、高性能</td>\n<td>高性能要求的场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>混合检索（Hybrid Search）</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">实际工程中，纯向量检索可能不够精确，常结合关键词检索（BM25）：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">hybrid_search</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> vector_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> keyword_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> alpha<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0.5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n    alpha: 向量检索权重 (0-1)\n    1-alpha: 关键词检索权重\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 归一化分数</span>\n    vector_scores <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> score <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> score <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> vector_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    keyword_scores <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> score <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> score <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> keyword_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    all_docs <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>vector_scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>keys<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>keyword_scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>keys<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    final_scores <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> doc <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> all_docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        v_score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> vector_scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        k_score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> keyword_scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        final_scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> alpha <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> v_score <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> alpha<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> k_score\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">sorted</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>final_scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>items<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> x<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> x<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reverse<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：Embedding 模型怎么选型？答：根据语言（中文用 BGE-M3、M3E，英文用 OpenAI、E5）、维度限制、是否需要多模态综合考虑。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：向量检索的召回率不够怎么办？答：增大 top-k、使用 Reranker（Cross-Encoder）做精排、使用多向量表示。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：如何更新向量数据库中的已有记忆？答：删除旧向量后重新插入新向量；或者支持增量更新的向量数据库（如 Milvus 的 upsert）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：向量相似度等同于语义相关。实际上向量距离近只说明语义相似，不代表对当前查询有用。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：ANN 索引不需要维护。实际上数据分布变化后需要重新训练索引。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：只用向量检索就够了。实际上混合检索（向量+关键词）往往效果更好。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>","headings":[]}